# Pi agent contract

- The root agent runs as Sol and uses the managed file tools within each agent's
  assigned paths.
- The root Sol delegates exactly one task to Astra for complex or large work. Astra may delegate
  scoped work to Sol, Luna, or Spark.
- A delegated Sol may escalate to its waiting Astra. Delegated Sol, Luna, and Spark are leaf roles
  and do not create additional workers.
- The managed role prompts, broker, scheduler, and ownership checks enforce this contract.
